<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V INDIA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>fourth day of the third test between West Indies and India at</p>
<p>the Kensington Oval on Monday:</p>
<p>West Indies first innings 298 (S.Chanderpaul 137 not out;</p>
<p>V.Prasad 5-82)</p>
<p>India first innings 319 (S.Tendulkar 92, R.Dravid 78; F.Rose</p>
<p>4-77)</p>
<p>West Indies second innings 140 (A.Kuruvilla 5-68)</p>
<p>India second innings (overnight 2-0)</p>
<p> V.Laxman b Rose			 19</p>
<p> N.Sidhu c Williams b Rose	    3</p>
<p> R.Sravid c Browne b Rose	     2</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c Lara b Bishop	  4</p>
<p> S.Ganguly b Ambrose		    8</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin b Ambrose		 9</p>
<p> N.Mongia b Bishop			5</p>
<p> A.Kumble c Holder b Bishop	   1</p>
<p> D.Ganesh not out			 6</p>
<p> A.Kuruvilla c Holder b Ambrose     9</p>
<p> V.Prasad b Bishop			0</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-2 nb-11)	     15</p>
<p> Total				     81</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-3 2-16 3-32 4-32 5-45 6-51 7-57</p>
<p>8-68 9-80</p>
<p>Bowling: Ambrose 15-3-36-3 (nb6), Bishop 11.5-4-22-4, Rose</p>
<p>9-2-19-3 (nb5)</p>
<p>Result: West Indies won by 38 runs</p>
<p>Man-of-the-Match: Shivnarine Chanderpaul.</p>
<p>Fourth test: April 4 to 8 in Antigua.</p>
</text>
